---
const title = '全球 AI 威胁面分层';
---

<figure class="diagram" data-diagram aria-label={title}>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 320" role="img">
    <title>{title}</title>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="model,app" x1="110" y1="70" x2="250" y2="70"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="app,data" x1="350" y1="70" x2="490" y2="70"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="model,tool" x1="110" y1="100" x2="190" y2="180"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="app,tool" x1="300" y1="100" x2="250" y2="180"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="data,tool" x1="490" y1="100" x2="310" y2="180"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="tool,infra" x1="250" y1="220" x2="190" y2="270"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="tool,gov" x1="250" y1="220" x2="430" y2="270"></line>
    <line class="diagram-edge" data-edge="infra,gov" x1="230" y1="290" x2="390" y2="290"></line>

    <g data-node="model">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="40" y="40" width="140" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="110" y="75" text-anchor="middle">模型层</text>
    </g>
    <g data-node="app">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="230" y="40" width="140" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="300" y="75" text-anchor="middle">应用 / Agent</text>
    </g>
    <g data-node="data">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="420" y="40" width="160" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="500" y="75" text-anchor="middle">数据 / RAG</text>
    </g>
    <g data-node="tool">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="180" y="170" width="140" height="60" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="250" y="205" text-anchor="middle">工具 / MCP</text>
    </g>
    <g data-node="infra">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="70" y="260" width="140" height="48" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="140" y="289" text-anchor="middle">基础设施</text>
    </g>
    <g data-node="gov">
      <rect class="diagram-node" x="390" y="260" width="140" height="48" rx="4"></rect>
      <text class="diagram-label" x="460" y="289" text-anchor="middle">治理层</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="panel">
    <h3>{title}</h3>
    <p>悬停节点查看关联层，建立「不是单点 Prompt 问题」的整体认知。</p>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
